    "description": "API test collection for JSONPlaceholder (https://jsonplaceholder.typicode.com/)\nCreated for Junior QA Portfolio - practicing REST API testing.\n\nCoverage:\n- GET users (all & by ID)\n- GET posts (all & by ID)\n- POST new user\n- PUT update user\n- DELETE user",
